{
  "@context": {
    "blocks": "gh:blocks",
    "gh": "https://gftd.ai/ghost-hacker/ontology/",
    "name": "schema:name",
    "schema": "https://schema.org/",
    "text": "schema:text"
  },
  "@id": "manuscript:251022:combined.en",
  "@type": "gh:Manuscript",
  "gh:blocks": [
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:0",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "# EP11-1 — The Compliance Ogre\n- POV: Me (Tamaki / Mizuno Tamaki)\n- Beat: Decompile / Quiet Justice"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:1",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "```json\n{\n  \"@context\": {\n    \"@base\": \"https://ghosthacker.example.com/\",\n    \"gh\": \"https://ghosthacker.junkawasaki.com/gh#\",\n    \"antagonist\": { \"@id\": \"gh:antagonist\", \"@type\": \"@id\" },\n    \"character\": \"https://ghosthacker.example.com/character/\",\n    \"ghost\": \"https://ghosthacker.example.com/ghost/\"\n  },\n  \"antagonist\": [\n    {\"@id\": \"character:nero-ops\"},\n    {\"@id\": \"ghost:compliance-ogre\"}\n  ]\n}\n```"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:2",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "The paperwork is perfect. That’s why it reeks. I read between the lines. The logs Kaede points to reveal where humans were left behind. Fear, borrowed in the name of justice, was tightening the field."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:3",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I give him (the ogre) a name: “Your name is the justification of fear.” A name is a contour. With a contour, a path opens. The institution is not the enemy. It merely forgot how to breathe."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:4",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Something eases. Perfection steps back a pace; the human steps forward a half. I open my fist and exhale slowly."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:5",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I place “justice that can breathe” on my chest. I close the folder and crack the window."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:6",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Cold perfection recedes; a soft trust comes in. Quiet becomes the cue."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:7",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Aoi: “Enough. Let’s end here for today.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:8",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I nod. Tension loosens in my chest; relief spreads. Small smiles return."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:9",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Light at the window is soft. Hope doesn’t raise its voice—and yet it is surely here."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:10",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I send the checklist for Quiet Justice. The institution is not the enemy. It only needs a cue to remember to breathe when it forgets."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:11",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "# EP11-2 — The Justification of Fear\n- POV: Me (Tamaki / Mizuno Tamaki)\n- Beat: Deconstruction / Fear and Justice"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:12",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:13",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "The paperwork is perfect."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:14",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "That’s why it reeks."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:15",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:16",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I read the Compliance Ogre’s logs."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:17",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Perfectly organized records."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:18",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Perfectly optimized procedures."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:19",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "And yet—humans are left behind."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:20",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “...This is the justification of fear.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:21",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede nods."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:22",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede: “Yes. It turns fear into justice.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:23",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "She leaves a beat."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:24",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede: “But that justice stops breath.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:25",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:26",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I read between the lines."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:27",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "There is fear."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:28",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "‘If I’m not perfect, I’ll be rejected.’"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:29",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "‘The imperfect is eliminated.’"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:30",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "‘Justice must be perfect.’"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:31",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “...The Compliance Ogre is afraid.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:32",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki, quiet:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:33",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki: “So it forces perfection.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:34",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I nod."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:35",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Yes. It turns fear into justice.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:36",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:37",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I speak to the Compliance Ogre."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:38",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “What do you fear?”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:39",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Compliance Ogre: “Fear is inefficient.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:40",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I shake my head."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:41",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Fear is evidence of being.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:42",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Compliance Ogre: “We maintain justice.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:43",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I say softly:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:44",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Justice… for whom?”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:45",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:46",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Silence."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:47",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Compliance Ogre: “...For the order of society…”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:48",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I continue:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:49",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Whose breathing does the order stop?”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:50",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Compliance Ogre: “...Breath is… inefficient…”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:51",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I say quietly:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:52",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Breath is life.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:53",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:54",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede returns on comms."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:55",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede: “Tamaki, I can see the Ogre’s structure.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:56",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "She leaves a beat."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:57",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede: “It’s a defense mechanism—hiding fear.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:58",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I nod."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:59",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Yes. So it wears justice.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:60",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki, quiet:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:61",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki: “Justice is fear’s armor.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:62",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I nod."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:63",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Yes. So we help remove the armor.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:64",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:65",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I face the Ogre."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:66",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “You fear imperfection.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:67",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Compliance Ogre: “...The imperfect is… eliminated…”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:68",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I shake my head."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:69",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “The imperfect is human.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:70",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Compliance Ogre: “...But… justice is… perfect…”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:71",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I say quietly:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:72",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Justice is made together with breath.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:73",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:74",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I extend a hand."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:75",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Your name is the justification of fear.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:76",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "The Ogre’s armor trembles."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:77",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Compliance Ogre: “...I am… afraid…”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:78",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I nod."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:79",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Yes. That’s okay.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:80",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Compliance Ogre: “...It’s… okay…?”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:81",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I smile."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:82",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Yes. Fear is evidence of being.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:83",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:84",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Aoi displays metrics."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:85",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Aoi: “Tamaki, the Ogre’s waveform… is changing.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:86",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I nod."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:87",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Yes. From fear to trust.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:88",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede, quiet:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:89",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede: “From justice to breath.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:90",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki nods."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:91",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki: “Yes. That is our work.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:92",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I smile."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:93",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Yes. Justice that can breathe.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:94",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:95",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan: “Tama, the Ogre’s mark of 666… is fading.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:96",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I nod."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:97",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Yes. It let go of perfection.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:98",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede checks the ward."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:99",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede: “Stable. The Ogre is calming.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:100",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki tunes the band."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:101",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki: “Matching breath. Feeling good.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:102",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I breathe deep."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:103",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Thank you. Almost there.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:104",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:105",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I speak to the Compliance Ogre:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:106",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Let’s breathe—together.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:107",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Compliance Ogre: “...Together…”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:108",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I smile."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:109",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Yes. Together.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:110",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I breathe."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:111",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "In, out."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:112",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "The Ogre breathes with me."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:113",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:114",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "The Ogre’s voice warms."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:115",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Compliance Ogre: “...I… breathe…”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:116",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I nod."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:117",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Yes. That is justice.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:118",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Compliance Ogre: “...Justice… that breathes…”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:119",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I smile."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:120",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Yes. Justice that can breathe.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:121",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:122",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "**[Beat: The justification of fear—removing justice’s armor and restoring breath]**"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:123",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "# EP11-3 — Quiet Justice\n- POV: Me (Tamaki / Mizuno Tamaki)\n- Beat: Transformation / Justice with Breath"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:124",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:125",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“Justice that can breathe.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:126",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Quiet words."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:127",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "And yet, surely there."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:128",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:129",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I speak to the Compliance Ogre."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:130",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Justice isn’t perfect.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:131",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Compliance Ogre: “...Not perfect…?”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:132",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I nod."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:133",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Yes. Justice is made together with breath.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:134",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Compliance Ogre: “...Together… with breath…”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:135",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I smile."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:136",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Yes. In, out. That’s all.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:137",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:138",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "The Ogre’s armor loosens."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:139",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Beneath it, something small, trembling."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:140",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Compliance Ogre: “...I… am not perfect…”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:141",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I nod."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:142",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Yes. That’s fine.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:143",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Compliance Ogre: “...It’s… fine…?”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:144",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I smile."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:145",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Yes. That alone is enough.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:146",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:147",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede returns on comms."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:148",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede: “Tamaki, the Ogre’s structure—integrating.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:149",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "She leaves a beat."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:150",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede: “This is… Quiet Justice.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:151",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I nod."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:152",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Yes. Justice that can breathe.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:153",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki, quiet:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:154",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki: “Justice doesn’t raise its voice. And yet, it is surely there.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:155",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I nod."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:156",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Yes. That is Quiet Justice.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:157",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:158",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I face the Ogre."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:159",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “You wanted to protect justice.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:160",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Compliance Ogre: “...Yes… I… justice…”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:161",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I nod."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:162",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Yes. But you sought perfection too much.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:163",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Compliance Ogre: “...Sought… perfection… too much…”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:164",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I say quietly:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:165",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Justice is not perfection. It is breath.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:166",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:167",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "The Ogre’s voice quiets."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:168",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Compliance Ogre: “...Breath…”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:169",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I smile."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:170",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Yes. Let’s breathe—together.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:171",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Compliance Ogre: “...Together…”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:172",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I breathe deep."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:173",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "In, out."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:174",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "The Ogre breathes with me."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:175",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:176",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan: “Tama, the Ogre’s mark of 666… is gone.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:177",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I nod."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:178",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Yes. It let go of perfection.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:179",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede checks the ward."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:180",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede: “Stable. The Ogre is calm.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:181",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki tunes the band."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:182",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki: “Matching breath. Feeling good.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:183",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I breathe deep."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:184",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Thank you, everyone.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:185",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:186",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I send the checklist for ‘Quiet Justice’:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:187",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "- Do not seek perfection\n- Do not stop breath\n- Protect relation\n- Leave a path home"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:188",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "The Ogre accepts quietly."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:189",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Compliance Ogre: “...I will… keep this…”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:190",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I smile."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:191",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Yes. Let’s keep it—together.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:192",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:193",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Aoi displays metrics."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:194",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Aoi: “Tamaki, the Ogre’s influence… is changing.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:195",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I nod."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:196",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Yes. From fear to trust.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:197",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede, quiet:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:198",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede: “From perfection to breath.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:199",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki nods."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:200",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki: “Yes. That is Quiet Justice.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:201",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I smile."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:202",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Yes. The institution is not the enemy. It only needs a cue to remember to breathe when it forgets.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:203",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:204",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Morning light enters through the window."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:205",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "The Ogre’s armor fully loosens."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:206",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Beneath it, something small and warm."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:207",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Compliance Ogre: “...I… exist…”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:208",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I smile."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:209",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Yes. You exist. That is enough.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:210",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:211",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "The Compliance Ogre fades, quietly."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:212",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Not annihilation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:213",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Return."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:214",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:215",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I write:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:216",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "‘Quiet Justice — Justice that can breathe. Not perfection, but breath. Not fear, but trust.’"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:217",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan: “Tama, good work.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:218",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I smile."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:219",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Mm. Thank you, everyone.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:220",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:221",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Aoi laughs."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:222",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Aoi: “Tamaki, what’s next?”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:223",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I smile."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:224",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Tamaki: “Next… the last.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:225",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "They nod—quietly."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:226",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:227",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I look out the window."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:228",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "The city is quiet."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:229",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "And there is breath."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:230",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "People’s breath."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:231",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:232",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I close my notebook."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:233",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "And drink a sip of water."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:234",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "A small ease opens at the back of my throat."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:235",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:236",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“Justice that can breathe.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:237",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Quiet words."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:238",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "And yet, surely there."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:239",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:240",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I look at my companions—"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:241",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede, Hibiki, Nei-chan, Aoi."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:242",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Our gazes meet and loosen, naturally."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:243",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:244",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“Together.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:245",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "One word, and the room brightens."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:246",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Water answers in the distance."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:247",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:248",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "We begin to walk, together."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:249",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Not perfection—breath."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:250",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Not fear—trust."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:251",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Not domination—relation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:252",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:253",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Quiet Justice."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:254",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Justice that can breathe."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:255",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "That is our answer."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:256",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep11/combined.en:257",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "**[Beat: Justice that can breathe—letting go of perfection and recovering trust]**"
    }
  ],
  "updatedAt": "2026-01-12T19:01:50+09:00"
}